 rs selected for Panel 1\, State v Robert Florian\, are to report on August
  31st and September 1st at 9am.\n  - July 24\, 2026\n  - All jurors on Sta
 te vs Kerr need to appear on Tuesday morning at 9:30 am. ( 1 hour later th
 an originally told) If you have any questions please call 564-2240.\n  - S
 eptember 25\, 0000\n  - Somerset County Superior Court - Skowhegan\n  - Al
 l Jurors selected for Panel B\, in the matter of State v Cheng\, due to sc
 heduling complications\, our trial will be starting later than expected. P
 lease call our Jury line after 9am on Monday\, September 28\, 2026 to see 
 what time you will need to appear at Court for the Trial. 1-800-872-5539.\
